Helena Herrer has denied that it was franchising, stressing that an exclusive network of stores aims to "immediate customer service, small and medium-size businesses when buying, service, after-sales and even packaging."
The store in Barcelona is part of a world-class pilot Pioneering program aimed at tasting possible problems with computer devices under warranty.
The online service is connected to the technical center located in Maastricht (Netherlands).
"So we will be able to solve problems within 10 minutes that otherwise can last up to two days."
"This system is specially designed for small and medium-sized enterprises and for ordinary customers, due to the fact that large companies already have a contractual service of technical assistance", Helena Herrerová stressed yesterday.
