When we asked President Felipe Calderon the critics of President Felipe Calderon a party (Partido Revolucionario Institucional) for his speeches within the four years he has ruled, César Nava urged PRI members to think about the six-year periods of former presidents Ernest Zedillo and Carlos Salinas de Gortar.
